What is incorrect about the work shown above? (Identify every incorrect step, not just the first.)

\stxOuttro{
The student subtracted incorrectly in the ones column and the hundreds column. Additionally, they regrouped from the thousands directly to make 10 more groups of ten, which is not allowed.

