\item
\stxKnowl{
For each mistake, describe why the student made that mistake. What were they probably thinking? What was their reasoning?

\stxOuttro{
When subtracting 0 - 4 or 0 - 7, the student may have been thinking of 4 - 0 and 7 - 0. They may have also thought that the zero in the hundreds column has no value, and can be skipped over to directly give regrouped values to the tens column.

