\item
\stxKnowl{
What feedback would you give this student? Your feedback should not only give the correct steps to take, but also address their misconceptions.

\stxOuttro{
Be careful with the order of subtraction! If we have 0-4, we don't have enough ones in the minuend to subtract, and must regroup from the tens first. When regrouping over a zero, we cannot just skip it. Bring the regrouped 1 from the thousands place over to the hundreds column. One group of one thousand is ten groups of one hundred. Now we can split apart those hundreds, take one away to leave us with 9 in the hundreds column, and give it as a ten (floating 1) in the tens column.

}
}

\end{enumerate}
