 \includegraphics{assets/R1/add-coladd-2.png} 

\begin{enumerate}
\item
\stxKnowl{
What is incorrect about the work shown above? (Identify every incorrect step, not just the first.)

\stxOuttro{
Instead of regrouping from lower to higher place values, they regrouped from higher to lower. At the end, they allowed the 13 in the ones to stay, bumping the remaining place values one place value too high.

}
