}
}

\item
\stxKnowl{
What feedback would you give this student? Your feedback should not only give the correct steps to take, but also address their misconceptions.

\stxOuttro{
You did a good job adding each place value's digits together. However, we need to remember that in this algorithm, the ones go in the bottom triangle, then we regroup in the top triangle. This is true for each place value's rectangle. What this does for us is align the regrouped values and non-regrouped values diagonally, so that every pair of numbers in a diagonal chute belongs to the same place value. Add diagonally in this algorithm, along the chutes.

}
}

